t@medsync.com</a>.</p><hr style='border:none; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; margin:24px 0;' /><div style='text-align:center; color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px;'><strong>MedSync</strong><br/>Automated notification – please do not reply.</div></div></body></html>"
